{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# 🧭 WUfB - Advanced Monitoring Suite\n\nSingle consolidated workbook answering the customer's advanced monitoring questions, one tab per topic:\n\n| Tab | Question | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| 📦 DO Efficiency by Site | Can we break down the Delivery Optimization report by site or subnet? | ⚠️ Partial (site derived from hostname, no native Site/Subnet field) |\n| 🚨 Early Warning Dashboard | KB success & failure trends | ✅ Full |\n| 💻 Device Health Correlation | Are updates failing on a specific model type? | ⚠️ Requires Intune inventory join |\n| 🔔 Custom KQL Alerting | Devices stop scanning, DO efficiency drops, new error codes on multiple devices | ✅ Full (as Scheduled Query Rules) |\n| 📊 Power BI Integration | — | ✅ Yes (external, guidance only) |\n| 🌍 Country/Branch Heatmap | Update Health by country/branch | ✅ Full |\n\n> This workbook combines and supersedes the standalone **Branch/Country Health Dashboard** and **KB Early Warning Dashboard** workbooks (their content is reproduced here as tabs) so the customer has one single place to look. The standalone workbooks and the underlying `kql/09`-`15` queries remain available for reuse/automation."
      },
      "name": "text-header"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "a0a0a001-0000-4a1a-b1c1-000000000001",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 1209600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 7776000000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            },
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 604800000
            },
            "label": "Time Range (applies to all tabs)"
          },
          {
            "id": "a0a0a001-0000-4a1a-b1c1-000000000002",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Tab",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "DOSite",
            "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
            "label": "Active tab (internal)"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "global-parameters"
    },
    {
      "type": 11,
      "content": {
        "version": "LinkItem/1.0",
        "style": "tabs",
        "links": [
          {
            "cellValue": "Tab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "📦 DO Efficiency by Site",
            "subTarget": "DOSite",
            "preText": "",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "cellValue": "Tab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
